post.summary:
Import a CSV (at most 1 MB / 5,000 rows): email, name, kind, interests, country. New valid addresses are added;
listed ones are left alone; people who unsubscribed are never added again; problems are reported per line.
dryRun=true checks only (200); an import answers 201.

parameters.description:
open: still with the coach (ASSIGNED, IN_REVIEW, MARKED, REJECTED, RESUBMISSION_REQUESTED);
done: the coach's part is finished (SUBMITTED_TO_ADMIN, APPROVED, PUBLISHED); all: every status.
Ignored when `status` is given.

isActive.description:
Compatible with the account states (capability accountStates): false suspends the account immediately (SUSPENDED;
all sessions are revoked), true lifts a suspension or reactivates a deactivated account (an archived account is
restored with POST /admin/users/:id/status-changes only). Prefer that route: it records your reason.
